WEBVTT

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.940
Huh?

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.900
Good morning!

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.900
It's the Hero, Rico-chan, 
and Eclair-san.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.920
We brought you some provisions.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.540
This morning, we and the imperial guard

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.910
helped bring in the harvest.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.410
We wanted to bring you guys some, too.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.620
Thank you so much.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.870
You guys are up early.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.920
Looks like it's the Hero's party.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.620
My lady!

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:32.510
Isuka-san.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.430
Good morning.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.260
Are you two going out somewhere?

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.170
That's right.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.390
An old friend is coming over.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.470
Wow!

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.780
A Dragon?

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.250
Ina! Isuka!

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.050
It's been a long time.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:00.410
We're here with Kratos to pick you up.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.530
Adele. Valerie.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.410
It's been ages!

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:08.520
You two are going somewhere with them?

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:10.640
We're old friends.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.560
Been that way for a long time, 
for better or for worse.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.110
Battle at the Cave of Sealing!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.320
We're off, then!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.620
Back in the day, when the Hero King

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.980
was actively being a hero,

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.870
those two were members of her party.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.940
The Hero Adel, and the 
Summoning Princess.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.380
The Demon King Valerie and 
the Swordsmith Isuka.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.980
And the young Master Swordsman, Hina Maxima.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.450
Hina... Isuka-san calls her that, too.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.530
The name Brioche d'Arquien is something

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.770
she received from the ruling lord

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:35.190
when she became a knight of Biscotti.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.940
Both names seem to be important to her.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.450
Once again, I'm surprised.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.450
I had never seen a dragon before, either.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.910
Kratos is a member of 
the Hero's party, too.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:51.500
Speaking of, where might they be off to?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.560
I heard they were headed for

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.710
the Fraise desert in the south.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.810
Something about verifying the

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.550
integrity of the demon seal, or something.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.890
So hot...

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.470
Just as hot as it used to be.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.420
Kratos, just a little further 
until the Cave of Sealing.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.720
We're counting on you.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.620
I haven't been here in quite a while.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:24.660
Quite right.

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:28.450
The sprites of the land seem to be well.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.270
It's so peaceful.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.710
It looks like there is no problem

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:44.530
with any of my sealing swords.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.430
That's amazing, Isuka!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.960
I just hope that the demons

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.740
who are sealed away

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:54.240
are returning to their uncorrupted 
form in their sleep...

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.110
If my theory is right, 
then it will definitely

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.480
work out that way.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.390
Demon transformation is something

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.380
that happens because the gods 
or sprites of the land are sick.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:03.910
With the right treatment,

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:04.990
they will always return to normal.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.190
I suppose the long sword demons disappear,

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.490
if the root cause is removed.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.460
The sealing method 
in this cave is to

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:14.880
return the naturally occurring 
demons to their sprite state.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.730
The experiment is progressing well.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.920
Now we just have to check the results.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:25.510
Not that it'd normally be my concern 
if demons were to run wild!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.490
This seal is quite worn down.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.130
The third seal...

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.510
It was quite a long time ago.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.800
What was this demon?

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.020
I believe it was a huge mouse.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.370
Yeah, that was quite a handful.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:43.460
At the time this sword was 
quite a masterpiece...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.150
<i>The third seal has been broken.</i>

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.650
<i>Commencing emergency shuttering</i>

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.730
<i>of this portion of the cave in order to prevent the</i>

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.540
<i>demons from moving freely.</i>

00:05:58.760 --> 00:05:59.950
I didn't expect that.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.810
Well, these things can happen.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.390
If it's coming back, then we'll 
just seal it away again!

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:05.880
We'll strike the moment it comes out!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.980
<i>Would the person in charge of the seal
 please deal with the demon?</i>

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.060
Little mice?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.890
Was it that kind of demon?

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.730
Mice, slow down! 
You mustn't run wild!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.680
Did it split itself during the sealing?

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.560
That's unexpected...

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.110
Yeah.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:28.650
In any case,

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.770
we have to catch them.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:36.000
Heavenly Crimson Blade!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.540
They turned into balls?!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.920
Then that means these little ones

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.590
already have the protection 
of the Flogna power?

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.500
They are part way to becoming sprites!

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.150
At the very least,
 they are no longer demons!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.720
You're right!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.170
Hey, you honeymooners there!

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.640
You can rejoice later!

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:57.760
They are half-sprites with

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.330
unknown eating habits
 and breeding speed!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.100
This means they pose a very real threat!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.520
You're right.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.480
Hina, can't you talk to them?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.900
They're all hungry!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.480
They're not in a state where 
you can reason with them!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:10.630
We have no choice.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.490
Indeed.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.120
Adel! Valerie!

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.250
You two!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.030
Owww.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.720
Damn mice!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:33.890
You two...

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.570
What is this?!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:44.480
We got younger?!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.230
This one, too!

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:49.610
In any case...

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.860
Hina, above you!

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:02.080
S-So heavy...

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.460
Hina!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.260
This way, Hina!

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.210
You guys, too!

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.770
This is bad.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.680
I'm sure I can handle this somehow.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.730
Adel, that's...

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.150
The recoil!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:28.820
Adel!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.610
It's not safe here, either.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.720
Adel, Valerie!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.250
Isn't there something we can do?

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.930
It's no good.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.560
My Demon King seal isn't working.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.560
Hina's in a sad state, too.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.730
We have no choice,
 we have to call for help.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.320
Help?

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.070
Last time we set up a 
network with the Heroes.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.070
Its name: BraveConnect!

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.800
Hello, my successors!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.770
Do you have a moment for me?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.480
Adel-sama?

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.140
You seem a little...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.600
Did something happen?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.200
To be honest,

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.600
we're having a bit of 
demon related trouble.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.320
Heroes, could I ask you to assist us?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:50.890
Of course!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.620
We'll leave right now!

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.600
We should all go!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.600
We're facing small animals.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.130
Please bring nets and cages.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.490
We're counting on you.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:02.840
Right!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.500
There are some fishermen here, right?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.940
We have an emergency,

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.500
please lend us your fishing gear.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:13.710
Sure! If we can be of 
help to you, ask away!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.720
We can get everything we need here.

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.720
Now, let's hurry!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.350
Okay!

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.740
It's starting to get bad...

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:27.890
Indeed...

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.770
Adel-sama, the Biscotti group is ready!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.660
The Galette and Pastillage alliance...

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.150
is ready, too!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.030
Wonderful, my lovely Heroes!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.970
BraveConnect, Link!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.420
This... is a summoning circle?!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.140
Summon Hero!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.090
You guys!

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:10.940
This is great.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.310
Isuka-san!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.980
Adel-sama, you guys are so small...

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.690
Even you, my lady...

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:17.870
Mice!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.490
There's a ridiculous number of them!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.110
Watch out, everybody!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.120
Mercurius!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.920
Nanami! Prince!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.750
We need to deal with these mice!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.270
Leave it to us.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.650
We'll do it!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.080
Rebecca, Couverte, thanks!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.250
Don't worry.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.510
I'm glad that my ancestor needs my help!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.210
Since all three Heroes are here...

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:50.270
Sink, Yukikaze, Eclair!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.730
Leave it to us!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.890
One... and...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.780
Lion King - Lightning Wave

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:21.880
Rebecca!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:23.840
Yes!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.260
Palette card! Gravity Ball!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.900
Nice, Rebecca!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.750
We got quite a lot of them.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.580
Yeah, we should soon be...

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.960
Ecle! Yukki!

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:10.320
What a catch.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.630
I wonder if everybody's okay.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.180
Let's split up to cheer them on.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:18.190
Those guys...

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.470
Becky!

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:21.440
Couverte!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.620
Guys!

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:40.130
Why is everybody so small?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.340
We let our guard down...

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.840
I used one of my ninja skills 
for our clothes and shoes...

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.590
I'm so ashamed...

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.280
Cou-sama, please take 
everybody to a safe place.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.700
There aren't that many left.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.480
Sink and I will go get them!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.230
Sink, Gaul...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.310
take these.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.630
These?

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.170
Jewels?

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.640
They will protect you.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.170
Roger that, Adel-sama.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:08.620
We will keep them safe!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.900
Let's go, Gaul!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.660
Wait! I'll go, too!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.410
Me, too!

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.010
All right. There should 
be a dead end ahead.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.750
You're really making us work!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:32.610
It's huge!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.470
Why is there such a huge one here?!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.930
This must be the boss!

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:53.160
Without a doubt!

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.660
A Bright Power cannon?

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.580
This is bad!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.030
Defender!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.600
That was too close.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.230
Sink, Prince Gaul!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.950
Are you okay?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.720
Becky! Nanami!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.680
We're fine!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.160
Of course we are!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:48.510
We can't let a dangerous 
demon like this roam free!

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.720
We're going to beat it 
down and capture it!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.310
Grown ups?!

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:53.280
Indeed.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:56.190
This mouse has used 
the stolen life-energy

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:57.470
to turn itself into a giant!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.970
No, not that!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.360
It's not...

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:04.940
Not that it matters! 
With Sink's and my...

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:09.230
...anti-demon ultra combo special 
move, we'll blast you away!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:12.530
Furious Lightning!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.910
Conflagration!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.830
Heavenly Edge! Sealing Strike!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.290
Wow...

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.570
Cool...

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.290
Sink, you're...

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.540
You too, Gaul.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.550
You're huge!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.210
You notice now?!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:20.010
So you two materialized

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.020
the Hero Crystals' power in that form.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:27.310
A seal appeared on the bottom 
of the crystal, however.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.400
On this one, too.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.600
It looks like it's carved in.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.150
This is proof that the Hero Crystal

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.240
has accepted you as its rightful owner.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:47.050
That means both Sink and the 
Prince are Hero material.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:51.160
By the way, why do you think we

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.930
haven't returned to normal yet?

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:55.450
We'll be normal soon.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:57.260
I do hope so.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.310
But Gau-sama, you're so cool!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.860
So handsome.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:03.910
That's true, of course.

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.060
I don't want to admit it,
 but you're not bad.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:09.120
Sink, it looks like you're going to get

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.300
much taller than me.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:13.100
You just think that because 
you're small right now.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.830
That's a really strange 
sight to behold...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.900
It warms my heart.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.220
You're returning to normal.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:28.080
Indeed.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.380
That means...

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.630
Gau-sama, don't look!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.420
Sink, you can't stay here!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.680
Hero Stinger!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:51.910
We're normal again!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.100
And my spell...

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.860
You're heavy!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.030
I'm not heavy.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.850
...is no longer effective.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:10.790
I knew it.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.920
Everybody, I have your clothes here!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.170
Oww, my eyes!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.580
What a day...

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:20.220
Thank you, Becky,
 for being so considerate.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.680
Don't mention it.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:24.060
We're turning, hold on tight.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:25.060
Okay.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:30.390
N-Not there, maybe somewhere else.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.800
Oh, sorry. Did that tickle?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.950
That's not it...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:38.190
It's just that,
 when you're in that state,

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.590
it feels...

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.910
...kind of illegal.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.160
Illegal?!

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.200
I didn't mean it like that.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.690
It's just that you look like that,

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:50.240
so it just doesn't look right.

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.260
Illegal...

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.670
Come on!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:55.940
So, after all that had happened,

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.420
the mice have been 
heavily sealed up again.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.520
I hope that they will be 
reborn as gods and sprites

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.430
of the land without further issues.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:08.230
We're back to normal!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.400
I'm a little sad.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.850
Well, in a few years,

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.820
those two will look like that again.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:14.810
I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:18.150
I'm glad, I do prefer 
this version of Sink.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.500
So you're not going to treat me 
like a criminal when I touch you?

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:24.250
I won't! See?

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.230
It's fine!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.090
Me, too!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.580
Cou-sama!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.540
Ecle, come join us!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.920
No, thank you!

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.210
Thanks to your help,

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.970
everything worked out fine.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.920
So that's what happened.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.370
What?! That's so mean!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:48.230
Everyone else always gets to have all the fun! 
That's not fair!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.430
It's mean to leave me behind!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.350
Sorry, it was so sudden.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:56.780
But I promise that I'll 
play with you tomorrow.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:58.300
Really?!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.410
Of course!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.270
I'm so happy!

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:08.210
Rebecca-san, was the adult Sink cool?

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:12.450
Uh... actually, very...

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.370
I wish I could've seen him!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.210
I wanted you to see him, too.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:19.960
So what was he like?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:23.390
Those two get along so well, as usual.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.050
Yup.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.480
I have to say, a stroll 
through the night sky

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:30.810
with my descendant is quite nice.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.690
If I'll do, I am always 
available for it.

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:43.840
Damn, that was horrible. 
My eyes still hurt.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.820
It's because of your usual behavior.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:47.170
Exactly.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.820
My eyes hurt.

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:33.660
Are you the hero whose special 
move is eye gouging?!

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:35.600
I accidentally unleashed 
my secret move...

00:23:35.140 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Esnart Arts and Music Festival</b>

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.010
So, next time...

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:39.550
Make sure to tune in!
